<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/33/eng@/~cl_13__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Section 9a of the principal Act as introduced by section 5 of this Act shall not apply to an officer who is commissioned prior to 1 January 2016 unless such officer has elected to contribute under the said section 9a within such time as may be determined by the Lembaga."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/33/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/33/eng@/~cl_13__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/33/eng@/~cl_13> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/33/eng@> .
