<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/33/eng@/~cl_13__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "An officer who has made voluntary contributions under section 10 of the principal Act prior to 1 January 2016 may, on or after 1 January 2016, continue to contribute under the said section 10 or elect to contribute under section 9a of the principal Act, as introduced by section 5 of this Act, within such time as may be determined by the Lembaga."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/33/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/33/eng@/~cl_13__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/33/eng@/~cl_13> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/33/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/33/eng@/~cl_13__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "3" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/33/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/33/eng@/~cl_13__subsec_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/33/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/33/eng@/~cl_13__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Where an officer referred to in subsection (2) has elected to contribute under section 9a, the deductions of his salary under section 10 of the principal Act shall cease."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/33/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/33/eng@/~cl_13__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/33/eng@/~cl_13> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/33/eng@> .
