<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/33/eng@/~cl_13__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "An officer referred to in subsection (2) who has elected to not contribute under section 9a and does not continue his contribution under section 10 may apply for the withdrawal of any amount standing to the credit of his account within such time as may be determined by the Lembaga."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/33/eng@> .
